{"id":"986fa2bc3322b549","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-per-type-system-extension.md","title":"Extension of PER type systems","display":"df-per-type-system-extension — Extension of PER type systems","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-per-type-system-extension","aliases":["72-df-per-type-system-extension"],"display":"df-per-type-system-extension — Extension of PER type systems","depends_on":["[[72-df-per-type-system]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter X, section 3.9, type-system extension and directed sets, printed pp.748-749 / PDF pp.760-761","source_statement_checked":true,"verification_status":"definition-contract-checked; source-statement-checked","proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-per-type-system-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-per-type-system-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-per-type-system-extension — Extension of PER type systems"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9e7370aef3007b80\" href=\"?note=9e7370aef3007b80\" title=\"72-df-per-type-system\">72-df-per-type-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter X, section 3.9, type-system extension and directed sets, printed pp.748-749 / PDF pp.760-761"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked; source-statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9e7370aef3007b80\" href=\"?note=9e7370aef3007b80\" title=\"72-df-per-type-system\">72-df-per-type-system</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)\">\\(\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau,L_\\tau\">\\(E_\\tau,L_\\tau\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|E_\\tau|\">\\(|E_\\tau|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau,\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)\">\\(\\tau,\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)\">\\(D\\subseteq\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)\\)</span>。函数按其有序对图表示。</li>\n<li>下式引入扩张关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqsubseteq_{\\mathfrak e}\">\\(\\sqsubseteq_{\\mathfrak e}\\)</span>、有向性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dir}_{\\mathfrak e}\">\\(\\operatorname{Dir}_{\\mathfrak e}\\)</span>、底系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_{\\mathfrak e}\">\\(\\bot_{\\mathfrak e}\\)</span>，以及有向族的候选并 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_{\\mathfrak e}(D)\">\\(J_{\\mathfrak e}(D)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\sqsubseteq_{\\mathfrak e}\\sigma\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nE_\\tau\\subseteq E_\\sigma\\land\\forall a\\in|E_\\tau|\\;(L_\\tau(a)=L_\\sigma(a)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau\\sqsubseteq_{\\mathfrak e}\\sigma\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nE_\\tau\\subseteq E_\\sigma\\land\\forall a\\in|E_\\tau|\\;(L_\\tau(a)=L_\\sigma(a)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dir}_{\\mathfrak e}(D)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ D\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall\\tau,\\sigma\\in D\\;\\exists\\rho\\in D\\;(\\tau\\sqsubseteq_{\\mathfrak e}\\rho\\land\\sigma\\sqsubseteq_{\\mathfrak e}\\rho).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Dir}_{\\mathfrak e}(D)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ D\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall\\tau,\\sigma\\in D\\;\\exists\\rho\\in D\\;(\\tau\\sqsubseteq_{\\mathfrak e}\\rho\\land\\sigma\\sqsubseteq_{\\mathfrak e}\\rho).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot_{\\mathfrak e}\\coloneqq\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing\\rangle,\\qquad\nJ_{\\mathfrak e}(D)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\bigcup_{\\tau\\in D}E_\\tau,\\ \\bigcup_{\\tau\\in D}L_\\tau\\right\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot_{\\mathfrak e}\\coloneqq\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing\\rangle,\\qquad\nJ_{\\mathfrak e}(D)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\bigcup_{\\tau\\in D}E_\\tau,\\ \\bigcup_{\\tau\\in D}L_\\tau\\right\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>扩张允许加入类型名称和新的类型相等信息，已有类型的成员相等关系必须完全保持，不能只要求L(a)包含于L′(a)。候选并对任意集合族都是有序对；只有有向族才由后续定理保证其第二分量是相容函数、整体仍是类型系统。空族的并也给出底系统，但有向性的定义明确排除空族。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-per-type-system","status":"resolved","id":"9e7370aef3007b80","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-per-type-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-per-type-system","status":"resolved","id":"9e7370aef3007b80","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-per-type-system]] 的 $\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)$、$E_\\tau,L_\\tau$ 与 $|E_\\tau|$；$\\tau,\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)$，$D\\subseteq\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)$。函数按其有序对图表示。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)","display":false},{"tex":"E_\\tau,L_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"|E_\\tau|","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau,\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)","display":false},{"tex":"D\\subseteq\\operatorname{TS}(\\mathfrak e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sqsubseteq_{\\mathfrak e}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dir}_{\\mathfrak e}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_{\\mathfrak e}","display":false},{"tex":"J_{\\mathfrak e}(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\sqsubseteq_{\\mathfrak e}\\sigma\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nE_\\tau\\subseteq E_\\sigma\\land\\forall a\\in|E_\\tau|\\;(L_\\tau(a)=L_\\sigma(a)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dir}_{\\mathfrak e}(D)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ D\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall\\tau,\\sigma\\in D\\;\\exists\\rho\\in D\\;(\\tau\\sqsubseteq_{\\mathfrak e}\\rho\\land\\sigma\\sqsubseteq_{\\mathfrak e}\\rho).","display":true},{"tex":"\\bot_{\\mathfrak e}\\coloneqq\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing\\rangle,\\qquad\nJ_{\\mathfrak e}(D)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\bigcup_{\\tau\\in D}E_\\tau,\\ \\bigcup_{\\tau\\in D}L_\\tau\\right\\rangle.","display":true}],"bytes":2199,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-410","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-per-type-system-extension|df-per-type-system-extension — Extension of PER type systems]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-408","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-per-type-system-extension — Extension of PER type systems](72-df-per-type-system-extension.md)"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"c